[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25142.67, "timestamp": "06:59:02", "text": "保留两个CPU机柜"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25145.628, "timestamp": "06:59:05", "text": "一起。你知道我想要什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25149.19, "timestamp": "06:59:09", "text": "建造？我希望建造一个像一个简单的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25151.35, "timestamp": "06:59:11", "text": "架子之类的东西，你知道的，就是那种东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25154.548, "timestamp": "06:59:14", "text": "是血清PC，对吧？对，就是那种。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25156.708, "timestamp": "06:59:16", "text": "那种东西。为什么我总是要这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25161.67, "timestamp": "06:59:21", "text": "携带两个大的矩形盒子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25165.35, "timestamp": "06:59:25", "text": "那玩意儿？不，一直都是。它们占用了太多空间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25169.35, "timestamp": "06:59:29", "text": "空间。不，是一条寿司龙，我真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25172.868, "timestamp": "06:59:32", "text": "我喜欢看他的视频，也很喜欢他的作品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25176.31, "timestamp": "06:59:36", "text": "所以，他有三四块，好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25179.27, "timestamp": "06:59:39", "text": "因为他的 Twitch 直播等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25183.27, "timestamp": "06:59:43", "text": "生产设置。所以他为他做了他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25186.15, "timestamp": "06:59:46", "text": "外形像服务器机架之类的东西。我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25188.31, "timestamp": "06:59:48", "text": "哇，这也太酷了吧！然后我看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25191.708, "timestamp": "06:59:51", "text": "低于服务器机架的价格。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25195.56, "timestamp": "06:59:55", "text": "贵得离谱，我就觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25196.75, "timestamp": "06:59:56", "text": "[掌声]"}]